  "description": "“Stay on land and live with me forever.” \n\nTo cure the Dragon King’s illness, the liver of a Rabbit divine beast is required. Byeol-hee, a soft-shelled turtle spirit tasked with luring the beast and obtaining its liver, arrives on land and meets the beautiful rabbit, Myo-woon. \n\n“...A fairy? Am I finally dead?”    \n“I’m not a fairy, and I’m not a woman either.” \n\nThinking Myo-woon is an orphan spirit who grew up alone, Byeol-hee asks him to help with her mission, believing he knows the land well. Meanwhile, Myo-woon, desperate to keep the first person he’s truly talked to in a long time by his side, hides his identity as a divine beast and accompanies her... \n\n‘That poor thing, he must have suffered so much.’    \n‘He’s a bit dim, but he’s such a cute little kid.’ \n\nA Rabbit and a Turtle with completely different agendas. A brand-new version of the classic folktale, 'The Rabbit and the Turtle'!\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14351471)",
